    },
    "Accuracy 4/5 (5/5 for Ultra, which FluidAudio measures ahead of v3 on all 24 FLEURS languages and on LibriSpeech) and speed 5/5 (4/5 for Redux) are estimates. NVIDIA reports average English WER of 6.05% for v2 and 6.34% for v3; v3 results vary by language. FluidAudio reports multilingual (FLEURS) WER of 11.67% for Ultra and 13.06% for Redux versus 14.81% for v3, with Redux slightly worse on English. For English-only Phonon-2, FluidAudio reports LibriSpeech test-clean WER of 2.47% versus 2.27% for v3, with the fastest v3-family encoder on the Neural Engine. FluidAudio documents fast Apple Silicon inference. Core ML conversion, audio and hardware affect results." : {

